sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Console
  participant CP as Control plane
  participant AG as Authority gate
  participant AD as Adapter
  participant B as Event bus

  C->>CP: resolve subject (upn, device id)
  CP-->>C: subject_id, coverage from adapter manifests
  C->>CP: open session (subject_id, capture_mode)
  CP->>AG: evaluate (mode, jurisdiction of subject)
  AG-->>CP: decision granted, basis, expiry, constraints
  CP-->>C: session_id, decision_id, expires_at
  CP->>AD: activate (session_id, decision_id, constraints)
  loop within schedule window, until expiry
    AD->>B: envelope stamped with decision_id
  end
  Note over AD: expiry or window close, fail closed
  AD->>CP: session closed (reason)
